ScholarMind Research Workflow

Overview

ScholarMind is an AI-based research and knowledge management system designed to help researchers organize, search, connect, and retrieve research knowledge.

The research workflow connects research data, papers, memory, knowledge graphs, search, retrieval, answers, and the research assistant into one integrated system.

Research Workflow

Research Data
      ↓
Data Loader
      ↓
Research Paper
      ↓
Research Memory
      ↓
Knowledge Graph
      ↓
 ┌───────────────┐
